  "title": "Nin Aad u Dheer / A very tall man",
  "description": "Ninka ay sheekadani ku saabsantahay si xad dhaaf ah ayuu dheeryahay, taas oo keentay inay waxa ku wareegsan oo idil aad u gaabnaadaan ama aad u yaraadaan. Dhibaatadaan wuxuu ku xalliyay inuu suubiyo waxyaabo dheerarkiisa u dhigma. The man in this story is so tall that everything around him is too short or too small. He solves this problem by creating things to match his size.",
